	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Graciam a deo per Christum in spiritu sancto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas, clarissime vir, ante aliquot annos ad me <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>perscriptas<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">ante aliquot annos ad me perscriptas <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint ist offenbar die nicht erhaltene Antwort <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> auf <persName ref="p9046">Pistorius</persName>' Brief vom 6. September 1538 (<bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> <ref target="file11212">[Nr. 1169]</ref>, S. 208-211, <ref target="file11212">Nr. 1169</ref>).</note> amoris erga me tui et candidissimi animi locupletissimas testes magna cum voluptate <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>legi, quod videbam et te talem virum tam clare et candide de regno Christi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>iisque, qui modo evangelium profitentur, de conventibus <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> patrumque veterum lectione <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pronunciare.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et profecto ipsa experiencia nunc doctus non possum non tuo subscribere <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>iudicio, quod de comitiis tunc dixisti, plus scilicet tales<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">tales <hi>für gestrichenes</hi> illae <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> conventus damni quam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>emolumenti perpetuo attulisse<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">attulisse <hi>über nicht gestrichenem</hi> dedisse <hi>nachgetragen.</hi></note> ecclesię Christi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tot enim comitiis cum ego interfuerim du<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>orum annorum nunc spacio nomine illustrissimi principis nostri<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> hatte <persName ref="p9046">Pistonus</persName> u. a. zu den Religionsgesprächen nach <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName> und <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName> entsandt (vgl. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> <ref target="file11212">[Nr. 1169]</ref>, S. 208, Anm. 1).</note>, semper lugubriori tum<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">tum <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> facie tum animo<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">tum animo <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen (in der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> tu).</note> et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>subtristior discedo, quam accessi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ita suas exerit in synodis illis<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f">illis <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> vires callidissimus ill<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>e <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Sathanę spiritus in suis et nihil non veneni<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g">veneni <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> splendida quapiam hypocrisi filiis dei non satis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sagacibus ubique et pacem terrenam magis aliquando<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">aliquando <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> quam Christi, quę omnem exuperat intellectum,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 4, 7</ref></cit>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>spectantibus obtrudere et in ecclesia Christi conservare conatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Qua re fit, ut non multa <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>bona mihi polliceri possim eciam de his comitiis, quae modo <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName> celebrantur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Nam quę hactenus <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName> acta sint,<pb type="edition" next="150"/> percipies ex literis<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Oben <ref target="file11540">Nr. 1497</ref>.</note> doctissimi iuvenis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p8011">Rudolffi Waltheri</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName>, qui modo nobiscum aura fruitur <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonensi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p18538">Cesar</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> quidem satis clementer res auspicatus est humanitatemque quampiam exhibet, estque dubio <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>procul ipsum serio querere pacem et tranquillitatem politicam <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Presertim, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cum tanta pericula a <persName ref="p18593">Turca</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note> imperio imminere vel coram cernat, et cum veram Christi <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>noticiam plane ignoret aque papistis omnino adhuc obsessus sit, ita ut plane manci<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>pium papę esse iurare posses, regnum Christi quo pacto possit promoveri, nondum video.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Papistica colluvies obdurata quottidie posteriora sua priorbus tanto peiora studio <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quodam efficit, ut nemo non videat sathanam, immundum illum spiritum, una cum septem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>spiritibus se nequioribus illorum corda plane occupasse<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 12, 45</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 11, 26</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quae autem conventio lucis et <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tenebrarum, Belial et Christi sperari potest<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 6,15</ref></cit>.</note>?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quare, quem finem sortitus est <placeName ref="l199">Ha<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>genoicus</placeName> conventus cum <placeName ref="l569">Wormatiensi</placeName>, hunc quoque mihi polliceor (regnum Christi quod attinet) <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>de <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonensis</placeName>[!] comitiis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quod vero hactenus ad te nihil dederim literarum, nolo ascribas meę negligentię; <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>commodi enim nuncii sese mihi extra nundinas <placeName ref="l157">Francofordienses</placeName> non offerunt, cum<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h">Von cum <hi>bis</hi> abesse <hi>am Rande nachgetragen;</hi> consulta aulica <hi>ersetzt ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> amplius non apud <placeName ref="l244">Cassellanos</placeName>, sed <placeName ref="l1678">Niddanos</placeName> concionatorem agam certas ob causas, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>et ob quędam consult<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>a aulica, quę si perfecta<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i">Von cum <hi>bis</hi> abesse <hi>am Rande nachgetragen;</hi> consulta aulica <hi>ersetzt ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> sunt, mallem esse infecta,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Es kann kaum ein Zweifel bestehen, dass <persName ref="p9046">Pistorius</persName> auf die Nebenehe des Landgrafen anspielt.</note> gaudeo me abesse<note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k">Von cum <hi>bis</hi> abesse <hi>am Rande nachgetragen;</hi> consulta aulica <hi>ersetzt ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Neque licuit nec<note xml:id="fnl" type="footnote" n="l">licuit nec <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> licet iam mihi <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiam</placeName> petere ob celebratas synodos.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Oro tamen, ut tua humanitas proxime futuris nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Francofordensium</placeName>, scilicet autumnalibus,<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Zum Termin der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Herbstmesse s. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10925">[Nr. 884]</ref>, S. 406, Anm. 5.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>in tanto mundi strepitu et furore me<note xml:id="fnm" type="footnote" n="m">me <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> literis nonnihil refocillare suis dignetur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Animi enim dexteritate et constancia firma amicitia nostra semel in Christo inita <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>florebit perpetuo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Utque evangelistas tuis commentariis illustratos ędas in profectum eccle<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>się Christi, oro obsecroque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Hisce vale in domino Iesu quam foelicissime una cum <persName ref="p8051">uxore</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="12"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> et libe<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ris<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kindern s. oben <ref target="file11503">Nr. 1460</ref>, Anm. 121.</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te <persName ref="p8413">Dionisius Melander</persName> noster petimusque obnixe, ut nostrorum nomine <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>salutem dicas <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandro</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> omnibusque symmistis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>D. <persName ref="p8331">Draconites</persName> quoque iussit, ut suo nomine te salutarem quam reverendissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ex <lb xml:id="p1z39"/><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbona</placeName>, raptim, 12. aprilis anno 1541.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p9046">Ioannes Pistorius Niddanus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ex animo tuus totus.<pb type="edition" next="151"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo tum pietate tum eruditione viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bulingero</persName>, ecclesiastę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo domino plurimum observando etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
